#!/usr/bin/env bash
# List developer commands available in this repo.
cat <<'TXT'
Developer commands (scripts/ is on PATH via .envrc):

  run [path]            Build the UI, backend and audio process without optimising our own
                        code (quick to build) and run the app; an optional path opens that
                        Engine library
  run-optimized [path]  The same as a release build (slow to build, smooth to run)
  fetch-models          Download the weights of Beat This! into models/ (needed to analyse
                        tracks; `run` and `run-optimized` use them from there)
  help                  Show this list

Cargo shortcuts:

  cargo build           Build the UI, the backend and the audio process (all are needed to run)
  cargo run             Run the UI (debug); build the backend first
  cargo test --workspace  Run all tests (UI, backend, gRPC end to end)
  cargo check           Type-check
  cargo clippy          Lint
  cargo fmt             Format

Nix:

  nix flake check       Validate the flake
  nix flake update      Update pinned inputs
TXT
